# Whitelist mode: GitHub carries only the buildable source + artifact.
# Everything else (docs, archive, agent configs, caches, local data) stays local.
# The .claude/skills/run-grepbot/ entries are tracked because SKILL.md is
# the documented driver infra (cdp smoke + REPL + fixture command used by
# the REDESIGN §5.2 test net); other .claude/ files (agent settings,
# keybindings, sandbox config) stay local.
# docs/ tracked because CLAUDE.md, REDESIGN.md, REGRESSIONS.md,
# DEDUP_MAP.md, OPEN-PLAN.md, INDEX.md are reference material shipped
# with the source (consumed by agents and humans working the repo).
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!LICENSE
!build.py
!grepbot.user.js
!src/
!src/**
!tests/
!tests/**
# ...but the whitelist above re-includes python caches under tests/; drop them again.
tests/**/__pycache__/
tests/**/*.pyc
!.claude/skills/run-grepbot/driver.mjs
!.claude/skills/run-grepbot/smoke.html
!.claude/skills/run-grepbot/SKILL.md
!docs/
!docs/**
